From c0b4a066878b83ff0717deece5772a031db79294 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChatGPT <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 10:46:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: split common Ethernet helpers

Move the register accessors out of airoha_eth.c and add a small
shared helper module for 32-bit DMA setup, DT port IDs, MAC address
initialization, dummy NAPI netdev allocation and generic ethtool
driver information.

This keeps the EN7523/EN7581 datapath unchanged while making the
common infrastructure reusable by the older EcoNet MIPS frame engine.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
